00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:19,360
This is Portswigger's deliberately vulnerable application. And if you're familiar with it,

16
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:22,720
you might notice that we've had a bit of a rebrand recently. It looks really snazzy now.

17
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:29,260
And usefully for us, it has a multi-step login. So if we head over, here's our login form.

18
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:34,520
Handily, it tells us what our username should be. And because it's deliberately vulnerable,

19
